{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20560","headline":"送吴链师归王屋 · 张籍","name":"送吴链师归王屋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉阳峰下学长生，玉洞仙中已有名。\n独戴熊须冠暂出，唯将鹤尾扇同行。\n炼成云母休炊爨，已得雷公当吏兵。\n却到瑶坛上头宿，应闻空里步虚声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}